        "prefix_token_count": 98,
        "step_number": 3,
        "text": "2.  **Analyze the Equation:**\n    *   Left-hand side (LHS): $3n$\n    *   Right-hand side (RHS): $9 + 9 + 9$"
      },
      {
        "aligned_char_end": 762,
        "boundary_aligned_back": false,
